      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹7.35 (down from ₹42.36 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹31.2b (down 24% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹197.0m (down 83% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 0.6% (down from 2.8% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 29% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 1% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
